              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tiabori oloing'ang'e neitoriori inaipuko enye aitoriokino dukuya, neipirare enkae enkae; nemeeta ake eng'ues nemeeta inaipuko are naitoipito osesen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
